<P STYLE="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 1px; color: White">Management believes certain non - GAAP financial measures provide useful supplemental information  regarding the Company&#8217;s operating performance and financial condition. These measures are commonly  used by management, investors, and industry analysts to evaluate REIT performance and facilitate  period - over - period and peer comparisons. Chiron&#8217;s non - GAAP financial measures included in this presentation are  EBITDAre , Adjusted  EBITDAre ,  Net Operating Income (NOI) and Cash NOI. Non - GAAP financial measures are not intended to be alternatives to net income, cash flows from  operating activities, or other measures prepared in accordance with GAAP. These measures may not be  comparable to similarly titled measures reported by other companies and should be evaluated in  conjunction with the Company&#8217;s consolidated financial statements. Non - GAAP Financial Measures 8</P>

